---
title: Bourbon Thyme Maple Sour
servings: 2
prep-time: 10 minutes
cook-time: 0 minutes
tags: [thyme, holiday-drinks, cocktails, bourbon, maple-syrup]
source: https://www.instagram.com/reel/DRU0Sj4kQE3/
image: https://scontent-iad3-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.71878-15/585343246_1390130929494756_7498258329033659579_n.jpg?stp=cmp1_dst-jpg_e35_s640x640_tt6&_nc_cat=104&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0xJUFMuYmVzdF9pbWFnZV91cmxnZW4uQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=HkQW_Pq9P9IQ7kNvwHtbHxe&_nc_oc=Adm3Ur2i0ArOmL2ZCIS1f0ouBsiY980zv8bjlHJrak4ZJGacJuPEH0BTsl-bVhFGHvA&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=23cyavPpczLqPfu7WWgvsw&oh=00_Afk3G-a55RLJUrHe67TzGMZ1txjmgfCCSQihnFeS0nZo6A&oe=69520142
---

In a #cocktail shaker{}, add @bourbon{4%oz}, @lemon juice{1.5%oz}, @maple syrup{1.5%oz}, and @thyme{2%sprigs}, then fill with @ice{1%cup} and shake for ~{15%seconds}.

Strain into a chilled #coupe glass{} and garnish with @thyme{1%sprig}.